// Title: Arbitrary File Download Via MSPUB.EXE
// Rule ID: 3b3c7f55-f771-4dd6-8a6e-08d057a17caf
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.execution, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_mspub_download.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
